-- 📚 꼭집 주거 사전 — 무주택세대구성원의 뜻과 주택 소유 판정 · 공통 · 2026
-- 재계산 SQL(관리 API에서 그대로 실행 · 읽기만). 범위: 공고일 2026년 · 유형은 housing_type_map 표준값.
-- 확인 2026-10-13 · 실행 3.2초 · 결과:
-- {"cls": 100, "def_strict": 16, "def_broad": 43, "rule53": 92, "ex": ["2015122300020880", "2015122300020871", "2015122300020870", "2015122300020859"]}
with a as(select distinct on(x.announcement_id)x.announcement_id,x.supply_org org,coalesce(m.std_type,x.housing_type)std,extract(year from coalesce(x.announcement_date,x.created_at::date))::int yr from announcements x left join housing_type_map m on m.source_table='announcements' and m.source=x.source and m.housing_type=x.housing_type order by x.announcement_id,(x.source='LH')desc,x.created_at desc),y as(select p.announcement_id,regexp_replace(p.content_raw,'\s+',' ','g')t,coalesce(r.class_name,c.class_name)cls,a.org,a.std from announcement_policies p join a using(announcement_id) left join policy_row_classes r on r.policy_id=p.id and r.axis='standard' left join policy_category_classes c on c.category=p.category and c.axis='standard' where a.yr=2026)select json_build_object('cls',(select count(distinct announcement_id) from y where '무주택·세대구성원'=cls),'def_strict',(select count(distinct announcement_id) from y where t~'무주택세대구성원\s*(이란|이라 함은)'),'def_broad',(select count(distinct announcement_id) from y where t~'무주택세대구성원\s*(이란|이라 함은|은|:)'),'rule53',(select count(distinct announcement_id) from y where t~'제\s*53\s*조'),'ex',(select json_agg(i) from(select distinct announcement_id i from y where t~'무주택세대구성원\s*(이란|이라 함은)' order by 1 desc limit 4)q))j;
